Package: simOutrank
Title: Outranking-Based Trace Clustering
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pavlos", "Delias", , "pavlos.delias@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements outranking-based trace clustering for process
    mining. Pairwise similarity between traces is assessed on multiple,
    problem-specific criteria using ELECTRE-III-style partial concordance
    and discordance indices with indifference, similarity and veto
    thresholds. The aggregated credibility matrix is then clustered using
    normalized spectral clustering or hierarchical clustering. Also
    includes outlier trimming, must-link/cannot-link adjustments,
    validation indices and diagnostic plots.
